WEBVTT

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.580
My head!

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.820
My head is splitting open!

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.130
Is this a new form of attack
by the dark alliance?

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.700
I told you not to get the regular size.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.510
I award you the privilege to enjoy half.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:23.460
Look here.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.970
And so, our day alone together began.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.280
Our one, precious day together.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.380
Hey, why doesn't he have his dog with him?

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:09.220
Triangle...
of Missed Encounters

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.240
Mr. Saigo doesn't come
with his dog in Kagoshima.

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:10.780
How come? This is Mr. Saigo.

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:12.900
Everyone knows Mr. Saigo comes with a dog.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.730
I don't see what all the fuss is about...

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.260
...but let's go look at another Mr. Saigo.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.070
What?

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.780
Hey, there's a dog way
over there! There's a dog!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.160
Okay, I'm taking the picture.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.120
Say "cheese."

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.550
What are you doing here?!

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.290
I got separated from my group.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.220
Where did you last see them?

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:34.810
At the souvenir shop.

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:36.920
Try calling them on your cell phone.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.600
She's finally awake.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.630
What a good idea!

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:38.630
Hello?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.830
What is it? I'm on after-exam vacation.
Why are you calling so early?

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.600
Did you get my voice mail?

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.780
Do not go and use my voice mail system
without permission...

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.350
...fake magician.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.330
Oh, be quiet! Never mind, and just delete it.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.350
Delete what? Your existence on this Earth?

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:59.360
No, that page on the internet.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.740
I'm sure you're the one who went and made it.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.240
What are you blithering about?

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:09.570
Just because you're getting fat
is no reason to take it out on me.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.750
Stop talking gibberish!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.420
You can't talk your way out of this one!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.430
Now listen. That page better be gone
by the time I get back...

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.010
...or I'll force a gallon
of milk down your throat!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:25.890
That faker finally returns my call,
and she's full of nonsense.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.270
I thought she was lonely
for the sound of my voice.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.170
Or maybe she was going to ask me
how I was doing.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.650
Internet page?

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.210
It really is amazing from here.

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:39.960
We're so close to it.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:44.210
Resonating frequency perceived
at a radius of five kilometers.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.160
Magical beings detected
near the vicinity of the crater.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.200
It may be the red dragon!

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:51.090
I'm amazed how easily you
come up with those delusions.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:55.640
Yuta, I fear that the dragon's body
has shattered through the crater.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:59.140
It may have split into seven parts.
We need to collect them all.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:03:59.800
Not!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.190
Wanna cross over to the other side?

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.020
Cross? Can we get there?

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.260
Yes, I think we can take a boat across.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.680
To there?

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.650
Schwartz Schneesturm!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.730
Schneeglöckchen!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:23.650
I'll go.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:28.460
I doubt it's anything like
whatever you're imagining.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.950
But we have plenty of time,
and it won't take long.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:38.000
H-hey, you're Shichimiya.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.190
Hero.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.940
Hero, it's you! Hero!

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:48.820
Oh, I'm sorry! I never expected to
find him in a place like this.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.990
You took the words out of my mouth.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.640
Are you also on a school field trip?

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:54.730
You too, Hero?

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:58.420
You are indeed the Hero with whom
I once trusted my fate.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.800
Wicked Lord Shingan. I'm sorry.
I apologize for grabbing on to him.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:04.950
I was so startled.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.500
It is far too late for that.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:10.030
Magical devil girl, Sophia
Ring SP Saturn VII!

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.900
You are now treading upon the territory...

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.290
...within my Wicked Lord's dark barrier
in which I cannot be defeated.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.290
Wanna make war?

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.390
Are you two alone?

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.980
Sorta.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.440
You're alone together, are you?
Then I will let you go this time.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:31.260
Sophia Ring has been tasked
with an angel-finding mission.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:33.780
I'll wander off that way. Bye!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:34.780
Hey!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.560
Um, actually...

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:41.320
I hate to ask, but can I borrow 500 yen?

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.580
I'm revived!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.670
How could you come so far
only to misplace your bag?

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.010
The angel may be running interference.

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:56.570
There are large shockwaves
coming from Area Zero to the south.

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.120
Can you make it back to your hotel?

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:01.590
Never fear! I have memorized every route!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.820
Don't lie.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:05.030
I can tell.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:08.130
You don't have a clue
which way to go, do you?

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:12.080
I knew it. Is your cell
phone also in the bag?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:13.060
Yeah.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.490
Come on.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:19.780
I'll be fine. The whole
world is linked together...

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.690
...so all roads lead to
where they need to lead!

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.750
I can make it back!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:25.570
Still.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:30.100
I will never go near any girl but you.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.450
Take this and begone
to wherever you choose to go.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.510
Don't solve it with money!

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:40.280
Damn.

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.090
Hey, Rikka?

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.170
I will soon locate it with
the power of Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:47.760
Come with me.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.010
Now.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:50.640
Rikka.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.850
Come to think of it, I found
a piece of paper inside my bag.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.100
Let's see.

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:00.560
THE WHISPERS OF
MORI SUMMER

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.280
Wh-what is this?

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.080
I'm busy.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:11.950
Fake Mori Summer, how do you dare
use the name of Mori Summer?

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:15.840
What's that? You're the one
who made that page, aren't you?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:18.530
I have never seen this page before!

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.130
You made it because you are the fake!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:24.720
Me? I would never make such a thing,
and you know it.

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.060
Then who made it?

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.170
You're asking me?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.510
Could it be the true one?

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.060
You walked through here?

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:39.680
I was tracking the angel's signature.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:43.100
Do you remember taking
anything out of your bag?

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:45.580
I got on and off the train with my friends.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.870
Bought some candy and we split up.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.940
Then I walked through here eating it.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:55.570
So you would have had the bag
when you were in the store.

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.700
A spirit tree.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:05.100
It sure is big.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.940
It must have incredible magical powers.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:07.890
Agreed!

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:10.310
You two agree about the weirdest things.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.050
Shichimiya, look.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:15.700
There it is!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.690
I knew it! Good for you.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.990
Yeah! You're good, Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:23.020
That is to be expected with
the power of Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:29.790
The angel!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:30.860
No, that's a monkey!

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:32.120
A dark follower!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.320
I'm telling you, that's a monkey!

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:34.530
Leave it to me.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.490
The power of the
Wicked Lord Shingan can handle this.

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.960
I can easily obliterate an ape being or two.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.730
Don't do it. It'll bite you.

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.470
We need to drive it away.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.970
But that could make it attack.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:48.500
I'll go.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:51.810
Hero.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.650
Shichimiya, do you remember...

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.430
...the split-second formation - revised?

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.240
Split-second? Hero!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.530
That's the plan.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:01.600
Understood.

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.550
Rikka, you stand back.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.440
What? Sure.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.610
Split-second Formation - revised!

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.640
Yes! Hero!

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:27.410
Shichimiya!

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:32.110
Run for it!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:35.870
Yuta.

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:47.680
Shichimiya!

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.380
You okay?

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:03.200
Yeah. We're rusty, but we pulled off
the split-second formation - revised!

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.550
Yeah, I haven't tried that since.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:07.720
I didn't think you'd actually remember.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.380
But of course!

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:14.590
I have decided to remain
unchanged for all eternity.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.320
Along with the magical power
I cultivated with you back then...

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.840
...and the missions I was awarded
as a magical devil girl.

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:24.820
You're quite the weirdo yourself, Shichimiya.

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:27.920
I'm not weird. I won't change, that's all.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.100
Here.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:33.250
What's that? An arcade token?

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:34.600
I knew it.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:38.050
Your memories have already
been taken from you.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:38.900
What?

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.850
Yuta? Yuta?

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:42.250
Yuta...

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:43.340
Can you stand?

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.990
Yeah. Thanks, Hero.

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:48.290
Yuta.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.710
Oh, Rikka.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:53.960
Yuta.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:54.960
Huh?

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.720
Yuta, you...

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:01.610
Yuta, you have forgotten your contract!

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.600
Rikka? Hey, Rikka!

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:06.740
Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:19.820
This Mr. Saigo doesn't have a dog either.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.250
I told you as much.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.810
Mr. Saigo doesn't have his dog with him
here in Kagoshima.

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:28.150
Oh, you!

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:35.290
Isn't that Takanashi?

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:41.970
Where did she go? I hope she didn't get lost.

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.530
She isn't answering her phone.

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:48.840
I'm sorry. This is 100% my fault.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.280
I butted in on your private time.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:52.940
No, I'm to blame.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.350
I was so wrapped up in the bag hunt,

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.260
I didn't stop to consider her feelings.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.190
So I want you to head back.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.620
Prefectural Citizens
Exchange Centre

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:03.750
I can't do that.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:07.000
It's okay, really. Go.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.810
This is your school field trip.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:12.550
Look, there's a bus stop right over there.

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:14.330
You can find your way back
if you get to a station.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.460
But I...

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.870
Don't worry about it. Bye!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.400
Oof.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:37.150
You need to lose some weight.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.960
Coming!

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.170
Hello, Togashi residence.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.250
It's Shichimiya.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.490
Is that you, Satone?

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:51.790
Sorry, but I need info quick, if you have it.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.040
Bus Stop

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.040
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:56.540
Okay, thanks.

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:07.230
So Shichimiya and Togashi were with you?

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:08.010
Yeah.

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:09.650
How did that happen?

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:13.810
That means they were goofing around
together and neglecting you, right?

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:14.890
No.

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:18.130
But you were all alone.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.980
I was alone because I broke away.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:28.410
What the heck is Togashi doing?

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.920
Received Mail

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.170
RECEIVED MAIL
IT'S SOPHIA

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:43.620
Map.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:44.800
What?

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.930
Got a map?

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.600
Huh? You ran into Rikka?

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:55.100
Togashi, what are you doing?!

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:57.490
Surely you know that
paying attention to Shichimiya

00:13:57.490 --> 00:14:00.110
while you're spending time alone
with Rikka will upset her.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:03.310
You're right. Do you know where she went?

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.320
She glanced at a map and dashed off.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:10.490
I see. It's okay, I'll take care of it. Bye.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.410
Again? Kuzuha?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.410
Incoming Call
Home

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.140
Hello?

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.260
Big Brother, what are you doing?!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.110
Not again.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.110
Sorry for making you come all this way.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.070
Relax, I came alone.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.470
No one will get in our way.

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:40.690
I see.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:45.070
I will give you fair warning.
Wicked Lord Shingan is all powerful.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:50.530
Even the most supreme level of light's
magical power cannot defeat him.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.760
Quit while you still can.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:53.410
Huh?

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:58.180
The manifestation of his physical speed
in this world is equally great.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.420
To fully observe it...

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:06.130
...is impossible.

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:17.690
Then find out to your peril just how powerful
the magical devil girl really is!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.400
Which would be fun...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.790
...but I didn't ask you
to come here to make war.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.960
I wanted you to hear me out.

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:34.910
I thought maybe I gave you
the wrong idea about Hero and me.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.970
Yuta, not Hero.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.050
Hero is what I've always called him...

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.720
...so he will always be a hero to me.
Grant me that much.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:44.500
Granted.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.140
Thanks. So anyway...

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:52.180
...you and Hero are bound by the
Lover's Contract, right, Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:53.770
What?

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.060
What's it to you?!

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:01.280
I felt like that once.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:05.270
Once, I also felt my heart flutter
when I thought about him.

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:07.960
And I wanted to always be with him.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.250
What? But...

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:13.690
But once that happened,
all sorts of things began to change.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:18.460
There is no doubt.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.710
That is definitely the
signature of a magical being.

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:22.120
Y-yeah.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.390
H-Hero?

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.510
What is it, Sophia?

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:31.300
Another inter-dimensional quake
through the alternate world line?

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.970
No, it's nothing.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:37.680
I could feel my powers gradually ebbing away.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:41.860
There!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:43.650
What's wrong?

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:45.870
Uh, yeah.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:49.320
I started to think that maybe
I wasn't a magical devil girl after all.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:54.500
I felt it gradually lose its meaning for me.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:10.680
And then?

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:12.260
Yeah. Anyway...

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:28.770
I decided that I would stay
just the way I was, forever.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:36.770
In accordance to the logic of
the world and its natural laws...

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:41.620
...I decided to stay as I was,
as a magical devil girl.

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:47.010
I am magical devil girl,
Sophia Ring SP Saturn VII!

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:51.910
I will forsake all else to live my life
to the fullest with my powers!

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:56.550
I'm saying that Hero's partner is you,
Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:57.810
That will not change.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.580
Say, Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:05.430
Are you going to stay the
Wicked Lord Shingan forever?

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:09.440
Do you really think you can revive
the Dark Flame Dragon?

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.820
Why did you give him that token?

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.820
I originally owned it.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.360
But I don't think Hero
even remembers that anymore.

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:24.390
Although it isn't my place to say it.

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:27.920
Well, I have an angel to track down,
so I'm gone! Zoom!

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:30.790
Sophia.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:40.250
Rikka!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:44.640
Yuta?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.600
Where's Shichimiya?

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:51.610
It's just that she texted me.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.910
She said I'd find you here.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.480
Received Mail
from: Satone Shichimiya
sub: From Sophia
...is at the Waterfront Park.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:58.780
All right, if you are a fake,
confess your duplicity immediately!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:03.440
My question is based on the most
complex section of the Mabinogion.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:06.320
If you are the true one, you can answer it.

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:07.620
It's here!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:11.500
What is this?!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:14.500
This is... death!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.520
I'm sorry.

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:21.140
It is not an issue. Sophia
told me everything.

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.640
I am the one who should apologize.

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:27.160
I am mortified that I should ever

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.480
have questioned you, Dark Flame Master,

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:32.600
with whom I have walked in this guise
for so many months and years.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.530
But the fact of the matter is that

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:39.210
we didn't end up spending much time together.

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:43.890
So I was thinking.

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:47.870
How do I say it?

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:51.220
Maybe it's about time,
or maybe it's a little late...

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:53.880
The timing just never seemed right.

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:55.250
What is it?

00:19:57.100 --> 00:20:00.380
Yeah. It has to be today or it's meaningless.

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:03.790
Here.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.890
It's your birthday today, isn't it?

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.240
How do you know that?!

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:15.690
I kept that information top secret...

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.730
...because there is such a
high probability of being hexed!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.290
It was there for the whole world to see
in your former email address!

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.290
Huh?

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:23.530
Just take it.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.710
Is this...?

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.520
Your old one is really worn out.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.090
I thought this would make you happy.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:42.720
It's amazing.

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:43.970
Schwartz Shield!

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.260
Schwartz Shield!

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:52.810
And this.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.270
I made it at the place we visited
the other day.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.020
It's a bonus.

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.120
This is true power of darkness.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:02.900
Shall we?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.370
Are you going to stay the
Wicked Lord Shingan forever?

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:13.210
Do you really think you can revive
the Dark Flame Dragon?

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:14.640
Yuta.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:19.430
Do you believe the Dark Flame Dragon
is alive inside of you?

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:20.520
What?

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.850
Will you become Ghelzonianses someday?

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.260
Don't call me that.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:29.780
Well, I can't say for sure about
the Dark Flame Dragon...

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.770
...but something could
be sleeping inside of me.

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:37.020
I always thought that the
obvious answer to that was no...

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:41.750
...but it's not so bad to believe
that something is in here.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:43.400
Yuta.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:47.460
That doesn't mean I can conjure up
the flames of darkness.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:48.710
You're conjuring them now.

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:50.330
Uh, no. This is different.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:54.480
Yuta.

00:21:56.470 --> 00:21:57.600
I love you.

00:22:03.070 --> 00:22:06.000
To Be
Continued
